bp?t=1780160366\" width=610 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a lone Neanderthal surviving in the prehistoric wilderness. Heal his ailments using handcrafted botanical remedies and uncover the secrets surrounding his mysterious totem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/6712d0f4d193bd5daea9830cfaac8e6b.poster.avif?t=1780160366\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/6712d0f4d193bd5daea9830cfaac8e6b.webm?t=1780160366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/6712d0f4d193bd5daea9830cfaac8e6b.mp4?t=1780160366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/ea4ef9c38ca5e484b042525ae56aeffa.webp?t=1780160366\" width=610 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth’s atmosphere is deadly to Xel. Use your crashed ship as a mobile research base - store energy, power advanced systems, generate CO₂, and recharge your equipment while preparing for deeper expeditions into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/ab9db9a848699bf3ec4147f13b8cf2ad.poster.avif?t=1780160366\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/ab9db9a848699bf3ec4147f13b8cf2ad.webm?t=1780160366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/ab9db9a848699bf3ec4147f13b8cf2ad.mp4?t=1780160366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/9d93034b7aa7f1cb6b4dfb304f44d9ce.webp?t=1780160366\" width=610 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and study prehistoric plant species</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create experimental tonics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore interconnected biomes filled with secrets and environmental puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage energy and CO₂ using alien technology and plant science</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a prehistoric world inhabited by extinct creatures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/849dd8313fc6e29e628d65219e2cc884.avif?t=1780160366\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Science-driven exploration adventure on prehistoric Earth with a relaxing vibe. Farming, crafting, puzzle-solving, and exploration on Prehistoric Earth, where you arrive as an alien botanist who is very good at plant research, but... can't breathe oxygen.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Polish, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“I love the look of the game, and the concept of a more relaxed open-world survival.”<br>Destructoid<br><br>“Every advance feels like a scientific discovery, not a military victory.”<br>Kotaku ES<br><br>“Astrobotanica is already giving me a little bit of a &quot;more than it appears&quot; vibe.”<br>PC Gamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/b9905916e3bb3eb1070f4b5e884b280c47107399/header.jpg?t=1780160366", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/f89d47afe84e486a77b9f33aa6e0f3e4e0f34438/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780160366", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/f89d47afe84e486a77b9f33aa6e0f3e4e0f34438/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780160366", "website": "http://astrobotanicagame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 6GB / RX 580 8GB or higher.<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Minimum spec aims for stable 30 FPS at 1080p on Low settings. Actual performance may vary depending on scene complexity, background apps, and driver versions.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Six-core Intel or AMD, i5-12600K / Ryzen 5 5600X or higher.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX-2080 Super / RX-6000 or higher.<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Recommended spec aims for stable 60 FPS at 1080p on High settings. Actual performance may vary depending on scen